url: "https://github.com/AppSprout-dev/Unsga3"
abstract: >-
  U-NSGA-III (Unified NSGA-III) multi-objective evolutionary optimization
  for .NET — single-, multi-, and many-objective problems with Das–Dennis
  reference directions, SBX, polynomial mutation, and niching tournament
  selection (Seada & Deb).
keywords:
  - multi-objective optimization
  - NSGA-III
  - U-NSGA-III
  - evolutionary algorithms
  - C#
  - .NET
